 1 OLD RUINS   Follow the light    You follow the light to ancient ruins. A lamp and a sword lie here.
 2 COLD RIVER  Take the lamp       You grab the lamp. Look. The old bridge sags.
 3 DEEP CAVE   Enter the cave      You enter the cave. Look. The dark hides a drop.
 4 DEEP CAVE   Light the lamp      Your lamp shows a hidden door. Look. The chest has teeth.
 5 PALE SHRINE Take the key        You grab the key. Look. The altar blade bleeds.
 6 IRON GATE   Pray at the altar   You pray and feel safe. Look. The bars are sharp.
 7 THE TOWER   Use the key         Your key opens the gate. Look. His hand rests on an axe.
 8 THE TOWER   Wake him            You wake him and he looks at you. Look. His eyes go to the crown.
 9 THE TOWER   Free him            You break his chains. He bows and the tower is free.
 1 BLACK MARSH Hear the voice      You follow the voice into the marsh. A prisoner begs in the mud.
 2 COLD RIVER  Take his ring       You grab his ring and leave him. The old bridge sags.
 3 PALE SHRINE Wade the shallows   You wade the cold water. The altar blade weeps.
 4 IRON GATE   Walk on             You slip past the altar. The bars are cruel.
 5 THE TOWER   Climb the wall      You climb the wall and fall hard. His hand rests on an axe.
 6 THE TOWER   Wake him            You wake him and he looks at you. His eyes go to the crown.
 7 THE TOWER   Show the ring       He kneels to the ring. Now you guard the tower forever.
